\ A same-scope redefinition of a generic that owns registered methods aborts with an
\ orphaned-methods error naming the dropped count. The redefinition claims no `override` marker.

area: generic ( x -- n ) [ drop 0 ] ;
area: method{ fixnum } [ drop 42 ] ;
area: method{ float } [ drop 43 ] ;

area: ( x -- n ) [ drop 7 ] ;
